      "slug": "behind-the-glass",
      "title": "Behind the Glass",
      "client": "Personal Project",
      "category": "Short Film",
      "about": "A stranger. A forgotten photograph. A secret from the past. She thought she knew what happened years ago. Until someone left her a reason to remember. \nBehind the Glass is a short cinematic mystery about a woman, a stranger, and a forgotten piece of her past. \n\nDuring an ordinary morning at her favorite cafe, a woman notices a man watching her from a distance. Moments later, he disappears — leaving behind a cryptic note, an old jacket, and a photograph from a birthday she barely remembers. As she tries to understand what happened, the photograph begins to reveal a connection to someone she thought was long gone. \n\nSome memories fade. Some people disappear. But some things are left behind for a reason.",
