      "slug": "reverse",
      "title": "Reverse",
      "client": "Personal Project",
      "category": "Short Film",
      "about": "A man trapped in guilt finds himself unable to move forward — in life and on the road. Haunted by the memory of a tragic accident that took someone he deeply loved, he keeps driving in reverse, as if replaying the past might change what happened. \nThrough the silence of an early morning drive and the blur between memory and reality, REVERSE captures a man’s inner conflict — the struggle between letting go and holding on. \nEvery moment behind the wheel becomes a reflection of his state of mind, where the road ahead remains distant, and the past is always closer in the mirror.",
